# --- The gearworks on a stone pier platform in the sea east of the plaza (a deck of boards 12 m up on stone piers, two
# bays long): the workshop (a radio tower room, its door west: wheels and cogs, the rats), the vault on the platform's north
# bay (its door a stone slab that rises when the counterweight drops), the counterweight hung from a gallows at the
# platform's south edge; the landing, a box; the third shuttle's lever ------------------------------------------------------
for px 34.5 45.5 11
for pz 9.5 32.5 11.5
place RT_GroundPillar - at $px $pz h=12 sy=7
next
