# --- The city's brass figures, frozen in the streets (and their walking twins, hidden till the city wakes) --------------
place Placeable_ToyRobot frozen at -2 34 h=20 sit scale=5 yaw=20
place Placeable_ToyRobot awake at -2 34 h=20 sit scale=5 yaw=20
