# --- Round the city: palms on the stacks, a pineapple, turtles at the stacks' feet, dolphins, a sunk crate of springs off
# the quay -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Palm 2" 1 at -52 -46 r=3 seed=2302
place Pickup_Landmark_PineappleLandmark - at -12 28 h=20.5
place Creature_Turtle turtles at -46 -72 h=-2
place Creature_Dolphin dolphins at 0 -110 h=-3
place Loot_SunkenBarrel sunksprings at -44 -76 h=-2 drop

# --- Raft's finds in the shallows round the stacks (lib_sea) ----------------------------------------------------------------
call shallows r=139 deep=5 n=2

# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (20 steps, 4 chapters) =============================================
info title=The Clockwork City
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A city of clockwork on tropical sea stacks - shuttle platforms between them, doors that open on the gong for half a minute, brass automatons frozen mid-step - and in the middle a clock tower whose heart was stolen. Find the parts, ride to the tower, set the hour, and the city wakes.
island on.arrive=message||Stacks of rock standing in the sea with a city on them - towers, domes, cogs on every wall - and between them, platforms sliding slowly back and forth over the water, all by themselves. In the middle, a clock tower. Its hands don't move.

story winder|Winding key|quest:Varuna_CraneKey|A brass winding key as long as your arm - the city's key to everything that winds.
story gear|Clock gear|quest:Tangaroa_GeneratorPart|A brass gear from the clock tower's heart, its teeth like a crown.
story mainspring|Mainspring|quest:Temperance_ElectricalCable|The clock tower's mainspring, coiled tight in its drum.
story clockkey|Vault key|quest:Caravan_KeyMayor|The founder's vault key, which drops out of the clock when it runs.

note welcome The clockmaker's welcome | WELCOME TO HOROLOGE\nthe city that winds itself.\n\nThe shuttles run every eight seconds. The doors open on the gong for half a minute. Everything here keeps time.\n\nThe harbourmaster keeps the winding key - you'll want it.\n- Teodor Vance, clockmaker
note harbourbox Harbourmaster's box | The harbourmaster's box: a logbook, an oil can - and the city's brass winding key.
loot harbourbox story:winder*1;Rope*2
prop harbourbox loot.refill=0
note timetable The city timetable | HOROLOGE - TIMETABLE\n\nShuttles: harbour - plaza - Hall of Hours - gearworks - observatory - TOWER.\nThe Hall of Hours opens on the gong: 30 seconds.\nThe gearworks' vault opens when its counterweight drops: 20 seconds (the chain is across the yard - run).\nThe undercroft: by the sea door at the plaza stack's foot. Hold your breath.\n\n(scrawled underneath:) THE CLOCK HAS STOPPED. Somebody has taken its heart.
note gearcase1 First gear's case | In the Hall of Hours, among a hundred stopped clocks, a velvet case: a brass gear.
loot gearcase1 story:gear*1;Glass*2
prop gearcase1 loot.refill=0
note gearcase2 Second gear's case | In the gearworks' vault: the second gear, still oily.
loot gearcase2 story:gear*1;Bolt*2
prop gearcase2 loot.refill=0
note gearcase3 Third gear's case | Down in the flooded undercroft, wedged in a pipe: the third gear.
loot gearcase3 story:gear*1;CopperOre*1
prop gearcase3 loot.refill=0
note thiefdiary The thief's diary | (on a bench in the observatory, the last pages blotted)\n\nI took the heart of the clock so the city would stop, so I could walk its streets in peace for once without everything ticking at me. Three gears I hid behind the city's own doors. The mainspring I kept.\n\nThe birds up here won't let me down. I'm sorry, Teodor. If anyone puts it back: he founded Horologe at three o'clock exactly. The hands must say THREE, or it won't strike.
note stash Thief's stash | The thief's stash: food, a blanket, a lantern - and the clock tower's mainspring in its drum.
loot stash story:mainspring*1;Cooked_GenericMeat*2;Placeable_Lantern_Metal*1
prop stash loot.refill=0
note plaque The founder's plaque | (on the clock room's wall)\n\nHOROLOGE, founded at the third hour by T. Vance.\nWhen the clock strikes its founding hour, the founder's vault opens to whoever made it strike.
note foundervault The founder's vault | Teodor Vance's vault: a clockmaker's fortune - titanium springs, brass, coin - and the plans for his zipline, which he said was the only thing he ever built that ran on gravity alone.
loot foundervault Blueprint_ZiplineTool*1;TitaniumIngot*4;CopperIngot*3;TradeToken*12;Bolt*4
prop foundervault loot.refill=0
note stallbox Market stall box | A plaza stall's box: fruit and springs.
loot stallbox Mango*2;Banana*2;Bolt*2
prop stallbox loot.refill=0
note sunksprings Sunk crate of springs | A crate of springs that went off the quay.
loot sunksprings Scrap*3;MetalOre*2;CopperOre*1
prop sunksprings loot.refill=0
note stepbox Platform box | A box on the gearworks' platform, left for shuttle riders who missed their ride.
loot stepbox Rope*2;PlasticBottle_Water*2;Plank*3
prop stepbox loot.refill=0

prop gong obj.name=gong
prop gong beh.use=Strike the gong (the Hall of Hours opens for 30 seconds)
prop gong if.use=has|story:winder|1\nstate|hourdoor|closed
prop gong on.use=message||BONNNG. The winding key turns in the gong's frame - and the Hall of Hours' door sinks. Thirty seconds!\nopen|hourdoor\nsound||event:/crafting/horns/viking\nwait|30\nclose|hourdoor\nmessage||The Hall of Hours' door rises shut.
prop gong else.use=message||The gong's frame has a winding hole - the city's key. (Or the door is already open: go!)
prop hourinside obj.name=hourinside
prop hourinside beh.use=Pull the lever (the door opens for 30 seconds)
prop hourinside if.use=state|hourdoor|closed
prop hourinside on.use=open|hourdoor\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever\nwait|30\nclose|hourdoor
prop hourdoor obj.name=hourdoor
prop hourdoor beh.move=0,-6,0
prop hourdoor beh.moveTime=2
prop hourdoor beh.moveMode=switch
prop counterweight obj.name=counterweight
prop counterweight beh.use=Pull the counterweight's chain (the vault opens for 20 seconds)
prop counterweight beh.move=0,-3,0
prop counterweight beh.moveTime=1
prop counterweight beh.moveMode=switch
prop counterweight if.use=has|story:winder|1\nstate|weightdoor|closed
prop counterweight on.use=message||The weight drops with a crash - and across the yard the vault door rises. Twenty seconds - RUN!\nopen|counterweight\nopen|weightdoor\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/scale/weight_move\nwait|20\nclose|weightdoor\nclose|counterweight\nmessage||The weight winds itself back up. The vault door drops shut.
prop counterweight else.use=message||The counterweight's chain is locked with a winding nut. (Or the vault is open: run!)
prop weightdoor obj.name=weightdoor
prop weightdoor beh.move=0,3.2,0
prop weightdoor beh.moveTime=1
prop weightdoor beh.moveMode=switch
prop clockheart obj.name=clockheart
prop clockheart beh.use=Fit the three gears and the mainspring
prop clockheart if.use=quest|16\ntake|story:gear|3\ntake|story:mainspring|1
prop clockheart on.use=message||Gear, gear, gear - and the mainspring, wound with the city's key. The clock catches its breath and TICKS. A drawer pops out of the engine's side with a key in it.\nsignal||ticking\ngive||story:clockkey*1\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/tangaroa/generator_placepart
prop clockheart else.use=message||The clock's heart, empty: three gear spindles and a drum for a spring.
prop handI obj.name=handI
prop handI beh.use=Set the hands to ONE
prop handI if.use=signal|ticking
prop handI on.use=message||The hands swing to one. The clock clacks, and nothing strikes.\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever
prop handI else.use=message||The hands won't move while the clock is stopped.
prop handVI obj.name=handVI
prop handVI beh.use=Set the hands to SIX
prop handVI if.use=signal|ticking
prop handVI on.use=message||The hands swing to six. Nothing strikes.\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever
prop handVI else.use=message||The hands won't move while the clock is stopped.
prop handIX obj.name=handIX
prop handIX beh.use=Set the hands to NINE
prop handIX if.use=signal|ticking
prop handIX on.use=message||The hands swing to nine. Nothing strikes.\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever
prop handIX else.use=message||The hands won't move while the clock is stopped.
prop handIII obj.name=handIII
prop handIII beh.use=Set the hands to THREE
prop handIII if.use=has|story:clockkey|1\nsignal|ticking\n!signal|struck
prop handIII on.use=message||The hands swing to three - and the clock STRIKES. One, two, three, over the whole city. And the city wakes: cogs turn on every wall, the brass figures in the streets lift their heads and begin to walk their rounds, and under the tower the founder's vault door sinks.\nsignal||struck\nhide|frozen\nshow|awake\nhide|stillcogs\nshow|turningcogs\nshow|citytick\nshow|chimes\nopen|vaultdoor\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/bicyclebell\nwait|1\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/bicyclebell\nwait|1\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/bicyclebell
prop handIII else.use=message||The hands won't move while the clock is stopped - or it has struck already.
prop vaultdoor obj.name=vaultdoor
prop vaultdoor beh.move=0,-6,0
prop vaultdoor beh.moveTime=3
prop vaultdoor beh.moveMode=switch
prop frozen obj.name=frozen
prop awake obj.name=awake
prop awake beh.hidden=1
prop awake beh.spin=20
